{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:29 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:29 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:29 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"涉事船隻被拖往船廠。劉漢權攝 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/08311debdf449ea01b70654303c619fa/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_14_1_.jpeg\"/><p>今(27日)早上9時25分，青衣路對開海域發生撞船意外，一艘往來上環與蛇口的客輪，駛至青衣油庫附近，據報撞向船塢，船上至少25人受傷，包括2名小童，其中5人較嚴重，救援人員正趕往現場營救，並將船隻拖到友聯船廠，將傷者送上岸然後送院救治。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f46c8663746fe7ef9467b0505d891f5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_15.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e09c174e6dcbf7f6773e73f93f0c1c9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_14_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批救援人員在船上。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5373074dea8e7e1e1f0fd69d534231c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"救援人員在船上處理傷者。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e27b9c5cd94fdec06325fc676673ea0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_32_23.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05c3aebeba91079308eb8f253d5b14cd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_32_22_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5aeb213a5d6d25d5b108bd33d853c159/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_32_22.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防出動輔助醫療裝備車。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62f72c8c8d612bbb9775608889b13adf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_23_31_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防出動輔助醫療裝備車。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e29b44ed4ff5c90d0b75771183ec5e43/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_23_31.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e965bd816915b258b13c15bb3560a708/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_26.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8842f829a6129f4f24baa49f580390ec/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b98af8c5ff685214b2c4f01a3e8ac89/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_25.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:03:52.788319+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:29:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:28.598114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:28.598114+00:00","content_hash":"31001f44600ef8e834eca93615af96146e93d2ddf239f0b6b9211446955d6b16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}